  "change": {
    "implementation": "MethodStore now selects an internal borrowed StoredMethodFactMatch directly from the exact owner/name bucket. It compares stored facts in index order, collapses exact adjacent duplicates, and AnalysisEngine expands only one unique winner. Final resolution retains sole ownership of ancestor/MRO, execution-context application, method_missing, ambiguity, and diagnostic policy.",
    "availability_semantics": "Any Absent fact masks the exact identity. Otherwise any Unavailable fact masks Available declarations; exact duplicate effective facts collapse, distinct effective facts remain ambiguous.",
    "semantic_boundary": "The borrowed stored match is crate-private, exposes no arena IDs, and becomes an owned domain MethodFact before crossing the engine state boundary. No long-lived cache or alternate lookup policy is introduced."
  },
